## 4. Daily Scheduled Drip & Dispatch Notification Engine

The dispatch system runs **hourly** via an external cron orchestrator (Vercel Cron, GitHub Actions, or Supabase `pg_cron`). It queries all users whose configured local delivery time aligns with the current UTC hour, selects their next curriculum video, creates feed records, and dispatches authenticated notifications.

```
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| Scheduled Cron Trigger (Hourly: 00 * * * *)                                       |
| Target: /api/cron/dispatch-daily-drops                                            |
| Authorization: Bearer {CRON_SECRET}                                               |
+-----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 1. Profile Query                                                                  |
| - Matches profiles WHERE delivery_hour_utc = CURRENT_UTC_HOUR                     |
| - Filter: subscription_status IN ('active', 'trialing')                           |
+-----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 2. Video Curation & Queue Engine                                                  |
| - Matches user.selected_profession_id -> topics -> generated_videos (status=ready)|
| - Excludes previously delivered video IDs for this user                           |
| - Performs batch INSERT into public.user_feed_deliveries                          |
+-----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 3. Magic Link Generator (Supabase Auth Admin)                                     |
| - Generates 1-click tokenized magic authentication URLs                           |
| - Target: /feed?delivery_id={deliveryId}&utm_source=daily_drip                    |
+-----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 4. Multi-Channel Batch Dispatch                                                   |
| - Email Dispatch: Resend API (Batch mode, 100 per request)                        |
| - Web Push: WebPush RFC 8291 standard with VAPID signing                          |
| - Logs delivery outcome to delivery_metadata JSONB                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

